ation consumes the prefix separately. Retry/probe/snapshot paths recover lagging replicas. Configuration application can recalculate commit with different quorum eligibility, but unlike append-reply advancement it does not release queued precommit reads.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"b-formation\",\n        \"b-recovery\",\n        \"b-persistence\",\n        \"b-membership\",\n        \"b-application\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\n        \"f-commit\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"s-ack-commit\",\n        \"s-log-commit\",\n        \"s-tracker\",\n        \"s-joint\",\n        \"s-replication-send\",\n        \"s-append-receive\",\n        \"s-ready-output\",\n        \"s-config-commit\",\n        \"s-proposal-read-admission\",\n        \"s-reset-authority\",\n        \"s-majority\",\n        \"s-log-append\",\n        \"s-restore\",\n        \"s-transfer\",\n        \"s-read-acks\",\n        \"s-durable-send\",\n        \"s-storage-response\",\n        \"s-ready-completion\",\n        \"s-term-dispatch\",\n        \"s-async-contract\",\n        \"s-storage-interface\",\n        \"s-unstable-role\",\n        \"s-initial-state\",\n        \"s-load-state\",\n        \"s-conf-change\",\n        \"s-conf-progress\",\n        \"s-conf-restore\",\n        \"s-applied-auto\",\n        \"s-node-completion-contract\",\n        \"s-config-options\",\n        \"s-log-delivery\",\n        \"s-log-apply\",\n        \"s-apply-response\",\n        \"s-node-loop\",\n        \"s-raw-interface\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"context\": {\n      \"explanation\": \"Campaigns require promotable membership and scan committed entries after applied for pending configurations. Real campaigns persist votes, aggregate eligible votes and elect an up-to-date leader; pre-vote preserves the term until support is obtained. Higher terms, same-term leader traffic to candidates and quorum loss remove authority; transfer requires caught-up target and times out. Reset clears per-election votes, remote match, read quorum contexts and transfer. Old-term messages cannot contribute ordinary support; committed log prefixes and old snapshot completion survive. Recovery rebuilds term/vote/configuration/log from caller storage.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"b-authority\",\n        \"b-membership\",\n        \"b-persistence\",\n        \"b-recovery\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\n        \"f-applied\",\n        \"f-commit\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"s-election-entry\",\n        \"s-candidate-follower\",\n        \"s-term-dispatch\",\n        \"s-leadership\",\n        \"s-reset-authority\",\n        \"s-transfer\",\n        \"s-initial-state\",\n        \"s-restore\",\n        \"s-tally\",\n        \"s-joint\",\n        \"s-log-commit\",\n        \"s-raw-interface\",\n        \"s-node-loop\",\n        \"s-conf-change\",\n        \"s-conf-progress\",\n        \"s-conf-restore\",\n        \"s-config-commit\",\n        \"s-proposal-read-admission\",\n        \"s-applied-auto\",\n        \"s-node-completion-contract\",\n        \"s-config-options\",\n        \"s-durable-send\",\n        \"s-ready-output\",\n        \"s-storage-response\",\n        \"s-ready-completion\",\n        \"s-async-contract\",\n        \"s-storage-interface\",\n        \"s-unstable-role\",\n        \"s-load-state\",\n        \"s-replication-send\",\n        \"s-append-receive\",\n        \"s-log-append\",\n        \"s-read-acks\",\n        \"s-log-apply\",\n        \"s-apply-response\",\n        \"s-ack-commit\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"connection\": {\n      \"explanation\": \"Election log freshness and persistent term/vote constrain who may form future decisions; current-term commit and active voter quorums constrain advancement by that leader. Configurations take effect via ApplyConfChange, not at append. Their applied-history bookkeeping is consumed by campaign admission and proposal serialization. Thus application acknowledgement is aut